<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE - ST Aerospace interim net triples.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ST Aerospace interim net triples.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		  (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   28.01     vs    6.86</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	 9.30     vs    2.30</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	    2.50     vs    nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		    298.58     vs  253.12</p>
<p>    Other income		  6.30     vs    3.65</p>
<p>    Operating pretax	   40.44     vs    7.40</p>
<p>    Associates		    6.86     vs    6.14</p>
<p>    Pretax			 47.30     vs   13.54</p>
<p>    Tax			    17.59     vs    6.31</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (1.69)    vs   (0.36)</p>
<p>    Dividend pay/register:   Sept 18/Sept 3</p>
<p>Note - Singapore Technologies Aerospace Ltd, a unit of Singapore Technologies, said the group benefitted from firmer airframe maintenance hourly selling rates and the stronger U.S. dollar.</p>
